ZjY2CzDbFYUYZ607JXe-4XeczmhxLPYuM2vyWBw&oe=69AEC4C4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Drops Training", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DROPS VR is an initiative by the DROPS Asia Chapter administered by Drilling VR to create a free Virtual Reality based awareness training and collaboration tool.\n\nStudents will learn through a series of real world simulated assignments to\n\n - Understand the potential of dropped objects\n - Recognize common causes of dropped objects\n - Methods for preventing dropped objects and preventing harm\n - Become familiar with reference tools and publications of the DROPS Forum\n\nDROPS is all about collaboration and the DROPS VR will be a tool where members can\n\n - Virtually remotely meet in a range of Industrial simulated environments\n - Interact with the Virtual Environment by pointing at and moving objects\n - Speak with each other through a multiplayer avatar system\n - Designed for subject matter experts to meet and collaborate for the prevention of dropped objects", "short_description": "Virtual Reality environment to learn about dropped object prevention."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dropsvr.org/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Drilling VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dropsvr.org/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "PRODUCTIVITY", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes"